WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:29.730
KNOW

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various
daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking
to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:09.980
On the fifteenth day of the
ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:09.980 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of
Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi
clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of
Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been three
hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:45.240 --> 02:46.670
I am in trouble!

02:46.880 --> 02:50.350
What's up, Ieyasu Tokugawa aka Ryogen?

02:50.560 --> 02:56.670
You really get it right for
our duet, old Dabinoji!

02:56.840 --> 02:59.800
I have to fight Musashi!

03:00.000 --> 03:01.230
It seems so.

03:01.440 --> 03:07.120
I was happy to appear so
often in previous episodes...

03:07.280 --> 03:09.590
but if I had known what
was waiting for me...

03:09.760 --> 03:13.150
There is no rose without a thorn, you know.

03:13.360 --> 03:16.590
Is Musashi the hero of this show?

03:16.760 --> 03:19.150
From the title, it would seem so.

03:19.320 --> 03:22.600
If I fight the hero, I will lose for sure!

03:23.360 --> 03:25.160
Will I die in this episode?

03:25.320 --> 03:28.550
Normally that's how it would
go in such a show, yes.

03:28.960 --> 03:31.350
I don't want to die!
I don't want to die!

03:31.520 --> 03:35.750
Do you still value life so much after becoming an ayakashi?

03:35.920 --> 03:38.120
Clearly, you old bag!

03:39.360 --> 03:43.560
But this show is not like other shows!

03:43.760 --> 03:45.000
How do you know?

03:45.010 --> 03:52.000
Well, this show does not respect any
classic conventions of storytelling.

03:52.010 --> 03:56.990
In the beginning, the creators had many
problems that cannot be disclosed...

03:57.160 --> 03:59.990
and had to change the
story as it was being told.

04:00.680 --> 04:03.990
In other words, it is
possible that the fight...

04:04.200 --> 04:08.670
between you and Musashi actually
conceals some unexpected plot.

04:08.840 --> 04:11.560
Does that mean I may get out alive?

04:11.720 --> 04:14.030
- I can't tell you that!
- Ouch!

04:17.170 --> 04:20.020
SIMULTANEOUSLY STRIKING

04:17.170 --> 04:20.020
EACH OTHER

04:36.680 --> 04:40.670
Ryogen, I have nothing against you...

04:40.840 --> 04:44.360
but if I want to get my hands
on the other demon gun...

04:45.000 --> 04:46.200
I have no other choice...

04:46.720 --> 04:47.950
I have to kill you.

04:48.560 --> 04:52.600
Really?
Do you really want to kill me?

04:52.800 --> 04:54.000
I'm dead serious.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.680
Flammable bullet!

05:10.960 --> 05:12.310
What are you doing?

05:12.960 --> 05:14.760
What if the flames kill me?

05:15.480 --> 05:17.360
Come on, get a little angry.

05:18.200 --> 05:20.430
Let's get down to serious business.

05:22.280 --> 05:25.320
Fox Laser!

05:28.360 --> 05:30.870
Old Ryogen can fight!

05:31.760 --> 05:34.670
I have the power of the ayakashi!

05:35.360 --> 05:37.080
I can't believe it.

05:37.440 --> 05:41.320
Given his appearance, I thought he
was just some buffoon in charge.

05:42.960 --> 05:48.990
I thought so too, but this situation
forces me to rise above that.

05:49.360 --> 05:51.240
No hard feelings, then!

05:54.280 --> 05:56.430
Ah! Fox Shield!

05:56.640 --> 05:58.120
You shot my shield!

05:58.600 --> 05:59.800
He stopped it!

06:01.760 --> 06:08.030
Shoot my shield too suddenly
and it will spill your guts out!

06:08.200 --> 06:10.270
The shield will spit them back!

06:13.840 --> 06:17.040
Let's have them fight for now.

06:18.840 --> 06:20.270
I have a <i>full house</i>!

06:20.440 --> 06:22.800
You are strong, Desperado!

06:23.560 --> 06:26.630
You beat me again.

06:28.440 --> 06:32.430
Not for nothing, I've been
playing <i>poker</i> since childhood.

06:33.160 --> 06:36.920
<i>Poker</i>? That's an European card game.

06:37.360 --> 06:38.560
It sure is.

06:38.680 --> 06:42.440
I never lost at cards.

06:42.920 --> 06:46.230
You have innate luck.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.800
The wind is picking up.

06:56.400 --> 07:00.230
How long do we have to
wait for Master Musashi?

07:00.400 --> 07:01.600
Who knows.

07:02.400 --> 07:04.440
Is Musashi okay?

07:04.840 --> 07:06.040
Who knows.

07:06.120 --> 07:10.430
And also, where did he go?

07:10.640 --> 07:11.840
Who knows.

07:23.720 --> 07:26.000
It's a distortion in space-time.

07:26.200 --> 07:29.270
What does that mean?
Is Master Musashi coming back?

07:30.200 --> 07:32.240
No, that's not it!

07:32.440 --> 07:33.640
An ayakashi?

07:35.200 --> 07:37.560
Doesn't look like an ayakashi.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.040
Urashima!

07:48.840 --> 07:50.040
Where is Musashi?

07:50.760 --> 07:54.830
He disappeared with the artifacts!

07:55.000 --> 07:56.200
Do you know where he is?

07:56.520 --> 08:01.200
Musashi is fighting Ryogen
in a parallel space-time.

08:01.880 --> 08:04.840
Ryogen?
Ieyasu Tokugawa?

08:05.000 --> 08:06.880
Are you behind this?

08:07.520 --> 08:08.720
More or less.

08:08.920 --> 08:11.720
Urashima, what are you planning?

08:12.440 --> 08:18.920
I would like to take you to the castle
where the fourth artifact is located.

08:19.760 --> 08:21.910
You would like to take us there?

08:51.600 --> 08:54.240
Monk Urashima!

08:54.400 --> 08:58.280
Monk Urashima, please answer!

08:59.000 --> 09:00.800
It seems nobody else is here.

09:01.400 --> 09:11.070
Strange, we should have immediately arrived
at the fourth artifact's castle with Urashima.

09:11.240 --> 09:13.750
Yet we are here by ourselves.

09:13.960 --> 09:17.720
That means this place is the castle.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.470
Really?

09:37.040 --> 09:38.240
Be careful!

09:41.480 --> 09:42.990
I'm gonna be crushed!

09:46.040 --> 09:47.240
Thank you.

09:47.880 --> 09:50.920
It was nothing.

09:51.640 --> 09:52.910
Thank you.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.840
Am I heavy?

09:55.400 --> 09:56.600
Yes.

09:56.960 --> 09:59.080
Maybe I should go on a diet.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.680
Yes.

10:01.800 --> 10:07.310
So this is the castle with the
fourth artifact Urashima mentioned?

10:08.080 --> 10:09.750
I guess so.

10:10.520 --> 10:12.960
And also, where did Urashima go?

10:13.600 --> 10:16.320
Urashima, where are you?

10:16.480 --> 10:21.760
Urashima, if you're going to
lead us, do it all the way!

10:31.360 --> 10:33.720
I would say he is not here.

10:34.280 --> 10:35.480
Yes.

10:36.040 --> 10:37.240
Look there!

10:43.960 --> 10:46.080
It will perhaps take us somewhere.

10:51.560 --> 10:52.830
Let's find out.

10:53.400 --> 10:57.390
We have nothing to gain
by staying here anyway.

10:58.440 --> 10:59.710
Yes.

11:00.840 --> 11:02.670
Hey, that's my line.

11:17.080 --> 11:19.070
Princes Kaguya, look!

11:19.680 --> 11:21.350
Let's investigate.

11:28.320 --> 11:29.640
It's useless!

11:30.240 --> 11:32.600
Here is my supreme
attack! Get ready!

11:33.200 --> 11:34.760
Your supreme attack?

11:35.200 --> 11:37.560
Special attack: Dance of the Fox!

11:37.720 --> 11:41.480
Shake, shake, shake.

11:43.920 --> 11:47.880
Pom pom pom, tremble,
pom pom pom, tremble.

11:51.640 --> 11:55.350
I don't understand what's supreme about it.

11:55.720 --> 11:58.080
Idiot, you let your guard down!

12:00.400 --> 12:02.390
I was aiming for this!

12:17.680 --> 12:20.670
Damn you, I was too nice!

12:21.280 --> 12:22.680
No more games!

12:27.760 --> 12:29.030
Special attack...

12:30.080 --> 12:32.040
Viscous Fox!

12:40.400 --> 12:42.680
Take a look at my Viscous Fox!

12:42.880 --> 12:45.920
Don't underestimate me!

12:46.280 --> 12:50.750
I'm not, but your attacks
seem a little strenuous...

12:50.920 --> 12:52.800
I'm getting a little restless...

12:53.200 --> 12:58.390
Kid, do you know why I was
nicknamed the Fox when I was Ieyasu?

12:59.080 --> 13:00.420
I never heard that before.

13:02.360 --> 13:04.750
Is that why you didn't laugh?

13:04.920 --> 13:06.990
I hate people who don't laugh at my jokes!

13:07.640 --> 13:11.920
Why would you want to make
people laugh during a fight?

13:12.080 --> 13:14.470
- Dumbass!
- What?

13:14.960 --> 13:17.110
Laughter is life!

13:17.320 --> 13:21.440
I dedicate my whole life to laughter!

13:21.720 --> 13:22.920
Eh, grandpa!

13:23.640 --> 13:28.320
Are you really the warlord who wanted to unify the country?

14:22.760 --> 14:23.960
Are they ayakashi?

14:24.840 --> 14:29.720
But the castles with the artifacts
should have ayakashi barriers!

14:30.560 --> 14:32.790
Who cares about that nonsense!

14:32.960 --> 14:36.000
You see ayakashi before your eyes!

14:36.160 --> 14:39.470
Yes. We'll just have to fight them!

14:39.640 --> 14:40.840
Yes!

14:48.760 --> 14:53.200
Princess Kaguya, ayakashi!
And there are four of them!

14:53.360 --> 14:55.110
Calm down, Danjo.

14:55.800 --> 14:57.310
I also have eyes.

15:06.400 --> 15:08.070
What should we do?

15:08.440 --> 15:09.920
It seems clear to me.

15:10.520 --> 15:12.510
We have to fight them.

15:31.600 --> 15:33.160
Ayakashi, on guard!

15:48.160 --> 15:50.750
That one is pretty good!

16:04.360 --> 16:05.560
Yin-Yang sword!

16:20.920 --> 16:22.400
He's strong!

16:23.200 --> 16:26.350
They do not move like ayakashi at all!

16:29.200 --> 16:31.790
They move exactly like humans!

16:32.280 --> 16:38.750
It's strange, I can't detect
any ayakashi energy. Why?

16:43.280 --> 16:47.320
Princess Kaguya, they are fearsome opponents!

16:47.800 --> 16:49.550
It would seem so.

16:56.520 --> 16:58.320
I'll just leave it at that.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.710
What do you mean with that?

17:03.600 --> 17:09.040
I don't feel any thrill
when I fight you, grandpa.

17:10.640 --> 17:14.630
I don't even know why
I have to fight you.

17:15.720 --> 17:18.840
That Ying-Yang monk outdid himself.

17:19.000 --> 17:20.510
I don't get it.

17:20.920 --> 17:24.470
There is something that intrigues
me from the beginning.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.080
What would that be?

17:26.560 --> 17:29.600
You and your companions,
you're fighting...

17:29.760 --> 17:36.920
to kill the ayakashi and correct history
that has deviated from its normal course?

17:37.600 --> 17:41.230
I don't really have any
great reasons to fight.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.910
But you may be right.

17:44.440 --> 17:47.800
Me, I sided with the ayakashi...

17:47.960 --> 17:53.470
to correct this false history in which the
Toyotomi shogunate was established.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.160
That would make sense.

17:55.280 --> 17:57.320
But now that Yasha is dead...

17:57.480 --> 18:04.070
Urashima said that history would
find its normal course again.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.880
So do we have a reason to fight?

18:08.680 --> 18:12.360
It's futile.
That's the impression I have.

18:12.520 --> 18:14.590
Now that you mention it...

18:15.240 --> 18:16.750
This is strange.

18:17.760 --> 18:21.720
I mean, you and I have the same goal.

18:21.880 --> 18:23.760
Yet we're fighting each other.

18:24.320 --> 18:26.230
That sounds like a good way to put it.

18:26.600 --> 18:27.870
Really?

18:29.000 --> 18:30.200
Really.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.560
Yes.

18:32.280 --> 18:33.870
You finally understand.

18:39.840 --> 18:41.270
It's you, Urashima!

18:42.200 --> 18:45.480
That's what I wanted you to understand.

18:51.720 --> 18:55.190
Now it's Kaguya, Yume and the others' turn.

18:59.080 --> 19:00.280
Welcome home.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.160
I am back.

19:02.640 --> 19:05.110
Weren't you fighting Musashi?

19:05.720 --> 19:06.950
Yes.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.920
And you are not injured.

19:10.120 --> 19:11.320
No...

19:12.320 --> 19:13.800
What's going on?

19:15.120 --> 19:18.350
I no longer know the meaning of life.

19:21.240 --> 19:24.680
Did you ponder the philosophy of life?

19:24.840 --> 19:26.350
You're too young for that!

19:39.080 --> 19:40.350
This technique...

19:50.920 --> 19:52.120
This technique...

19:55.480 --> 19:58.950
Now that I think about it, these ayakashi...

20:00.240 --> 20:04.280
do not give off any energy.
Also...

20:05.080 --> 20:08.230
this technique is Yume's.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.030
There is no doubt about it!

20:19.600 --> 20:22.320
This technique is Kaguya's!

20:25.280 --> 20:27.720
Yume, what are you doing?

20:27.920 --> 20:29.670
It's dangerous, get away!

20:30.320 --> 20:32.360
Yume, get away!

20:33.960 --> 20:36.320
Yume is too close!

20:42.880 --> 20:44.080
Princess Kaguya!

20:44.400 --> 20:46.710
Get away from the ayakashi!

20:47.520 --> 20:48.720
No.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.670
What?

20:56.280 --> 20:59.430
- Princess Yume!
- Get away! Yume!

21:00.040 --> 21:01.390
Everything is fine.

21:03.560 --> 21:06.680
This ayakashi is none other than Kaguya.

21:12.280 --> 21:13.920
It is Princess Kaguya?

21:14.480 --> 21:15.910
How do you know?

21:16.120 --> 21:17.520
Princess Kaguya?

21:18.200 --> 21:20.510
This ayakashi is Yume.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.790
Princess Kaguya!

21:42.280 --> 21:43.790
Master Ronin!

21:44.000 --> 21:46.040
Sasuke Sarutobi?

21:46.200 --> 21:48.760
What's going on?

21:49.320 --> 21:50.720
Princess Kaguya?

21:54.200 --> 21:56.190
It's really you.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.880
Kaguya...

22:03.480 --> 22:06.120
The fourth artifact.

22:07.080 --> 22:13.110
Was all this fighting a spell by
Urashima to protect the castle?

22:13.560 --> 22:15.710
He doesn't play around.

22:16.080 --> 22:21.510
I mean, did we fall for Urashima's trap?

22:22.320 --> 22:23.520
What a shame...

22:23.840 --> 22:25.160
Yes.

22:25.640 --> 22:28.360
But we're all safe, and that's what counts.

22:29.400 --> 22:32.280
I don't see Musashi.

22:34.960 --> 22:39.880
Damn Urashima!
Always throwing me from the air!

22:40.960 --> 22:42.160
What is this?

22:42.560 --> 22:43.830
What are you doing here?

22:44.360 --> 22:46.510
We should be asking you that.

22:46.680 --> 22:49.430
One moment you are there,
then you're gone.

22:50.040 --> 22:53.400
We've seen it all in your absence!

22:53.880 --> 22:55.080
So have I!

22:56.240 --> 22:57.440
Musashi.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.200
Here.

23:00.040 --> 23:01.360
The artifact!

23:02.120 --> 23:06.240
Have you joined forces to find it?

23:06.880 --> 23:10.350
In fact, it was the other way around.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.720
Yes.

23:12.280 --> 23:13.510
What do you mean?

23:14.160 --> 23:20.920
In retrospect, the movements of an ayakashi
were clearly the same as Sasuke Sarutobi.

23:21.400 --> 23:23.390
You're not so bad yourself.

23:23.920 --> 23:25.590
What are you talking about?

23:26.360 --> 23:30.560
Kaguya, your back kicks are strong!

23:31.440 --> 23:34.030
Your compliments are an honor to me.

23:34.240 --> 23:38.550
What are you talking about?
Explain a little!

23:40.720 --> 23:43.520
What's important is that everyone is safe.

23:44.240 --> 23:47.920
Can you guys fill me in already?

24:23.440 --> 24:25.190
MAKE HASTE

24:27.320 --> 24:31.080
THEY'RE CUTTING OFF YOUR ESCAPE

24:31.240 --> 24:34.950
IN THIS TWILIGHT TOWN
I HEAR PIERCING SOUNDS

24:35.120 --> 24:38.880
LIKE A WANDERING CAT

24:39.040 --> 24:40.790
WITHOUT KNOWING

24:40.960 --> 24:42.760
WHERE TO GO

24:42.920 --> 24:46.680
I'M TRAPPED IN THIS TOWN THAT NEVER SLEEPS

24:50.520 --> 24:55.200
SEEING MYSELF TRANSFORM

24:55.360 --> 24:57.720
I'M HOLDING ON

24:57.880 --> 25:01.160
FOR AS LONG AS POSSIBLE

25:03.200 --> 25:07.830
I'LL SHOW YOU THAT I CAN

25:08.000 --> 25:10.560
WIN OVER THIS TOWN

25:11.720 --> 25:13.760
FROM MY BURNING HEART

25:13.920 --> 25:15.910
SHINE SO MANY

25:16.080 --> 25:19.870
DAZZLING COLORS AND LIGHTS

25:20.040 --> 25:21.550
FLOODING ALL OVER

25:21.720 --> 25:23.710
SCATTERING ALL OVER

25:23.880 --> 25:27.030
SURROUNDING ME

25:27.200 --> 25:29.650
SOLEMNLY

25:31.040 --> 25:34.920
What, Kaguya and Yume started singing?

25:35.120 --> 25:37.760
And when they sing, Urashima feels sick?

25:38.120 --> 25:40.660
Those three are hiding something!

25:41.120 --> 25:44.510
The next chapter: <i>Rest Day!</i>
